<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>→ 句読点を削除して単語数を数える。</title>
<style>
body {
  font-family: "Hiragino Sans","Noto Sans JP",sans-serif;
  background: #f8f8f8;
  padding: 2em;
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: auto;
}
h1 { font-size: 1.4em; color: #333; margin-bottom: 0.3em; }
p  { color: #555; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1.2em; }
button {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.5em 1.4em;
  background: #3a6ea5;
  color: #fff;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  margin-bottom: 1em;
}
button:hover { background: #2f5685; }
.container {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 1em;
  margin-top: 0.5em;
}
.code, .output {
  flex: 1;
  font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, "Noto Sans Mono CJK JP", monospace;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  border: 1px solid #bbb;
  background: #fff;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  height: 24em;
  overflow-y: auto;
  padding: 1.2em;
  white-space: pre-line;
  word-break: break-word;
}
.label {
  font-weight: bold;
  display: block;
  margin: 0 0 0.4em 0;
}
.output {
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  transition: all 0.4s ease;
}
.output.show {
  opacity: 1;
  visibility: visible;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>→ 句読点を削除して単語数を数える。</h1>
<p>“No coffee, no code.” の句読点を削除して単語を数え、  
“coffee” を “tea” に置き換えてみよう。</p>

<button onclick="toggleOutput()">結果を表示</button>

<div class="container">
  <div class="code" id="codeBox">
    <span class="label">コード入力</span>
import string

text = "No coffee, no code."
clean = text.translate(str.maketrans("", "", string.punctuation))
words = clean.split()
print("単語数:", len(words))
print(clean.replace("coffee", "tea"))
  </div>

  <div class="output" id="outputBox">
    <span class="label">出力結果</span>
['No', 'coffee', 'no', 'code']
単語数: 4
No tea no code
  </div>
</div>

<script>
function toggleOutput(){
  const out=document.getElementById("outputBox");
  out.classList.toggle("show");
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
